  "body": "Decision record for issue #5908 (parent #5688 §2.4), from queue task 14233 (lane code-d).\n\nSettles: the ordered decompose-vs-attach decision procedure (addressed → queried → reasoned → verbatim → display, default attach), ten worked grey cases, payload referencing/resolution through IDs (no bytes in triples, invariants I1–I6), and one-way lossless promotion. Parent #5688 decisions explicitly not re-decided (§7); alternatives rejected in §8; open questions assigned in §9.\n\nDoc-only change: `doc/2026-11-09_decision_id5908_payload_boundary.md` (245 lines).\n\nCloses #5908\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796792862&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7958&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7958&signature=eef02be95288574d669727b2bc44d52e1856c43e80ba21d6224ed0ba8b5d001d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7958?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
